-- The probe for the walkthrough's last step: each time built-in, and REFUSE, on a line of its own, so that the
-- stable build's answer for each can be read on its own.
-- Run it with the stable build and with the unstable build; WALKTHROUGH.md copies what the stable build prints.
-- The decorator is in walkthrough-main-probe-decorator.l4: on the stable build it stops the whole file.
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
TIMEZONE IS "Asia/Singapore"

#EVAL TODAY
#EVAL `RULES EFFECTIVE DATE`
#EVAL `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (Date 1 6 2011) TODAY
#EVAL `EVAL UNDER VALID TIME` (Date 1 6 2011) TODAY
#EVAL `EVAL AS OF SYSTEM TIME` (Date 1 6 2011) TODAY
#EVAL REFUSE "not covered"
